infinite-patch 1
# Berlin School Sequencer Dual PM Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.5
  i steps 16
  i note0 45
  i note1 45
  i note2 48
  i note3 52
  i note4 45
  i note5 50
  i note6 55
  i note7 52
  i note8 45
  i note9 45
  i note10 48
  i note11 52
  i note12 57
  i note13 55
  i note14 52
  i note15 50
  b en0 1
  b en1 1
  b en2 1
  b en3 1
  b en4 1
  b en5 1
  b en6 1
  b en7 1
  b en8 1
  b en9 1
